; The Sift DX ppx RULES — three small modules, ONE plain library (NOT a ppx_rewriter):
;   Sift_ppx_rules       — the [@@deriving model] codec + Fields deriver (and the shared model_core)
;   Sift_mongo_ppx_rules — the Mongo query DSL: [%q] [%fields] [%sort] [%set] [%index]
;   Collection_deriver   — the [@@deriving collection] deriver (the store/reactive tail)
; A driver links this and registers them in its ONE ppx pass: fennec's fur.ppx does (so every .mlx/.ml
; on (pps fennec.fur.ppx) gets the whole DX), as does the standalone fennec.pulse.sift.ppx. Unwrapped,
; so a driver references the three modules directly.
(library
 (name fennec_pulse_sift_ppx_rules)
 (public_name fennec.pulse.sift.ppx.rules)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries ppxlib)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppxlib.metaquot)))
